  "idea": "Webflow localization update for multi-region landing pages",
  "text": "Webflow just made building multi-language websites a seamless one-click process. Agencies historically spent weeks duplicating entire site architectures and CMS databases just to launch in a second language. Maintaining duplicate page trees breaks design consistency and creates nightmare merge conflicts whenever layout changes occur. Webflow Localization enables native automated translation, localized asset management, and locale-specific styles directly inside the visual canvas. This delivers global websites in record time.",
